  "message": "We’ve got eight agents you can tap:\n\n- mapper_cash – looks for patterns in cash purchases  \n- mapper_card – tracks card‑based spending  \n- mapper_bank – analyzes ACH and online transfers, usually recurring bills  \n- mapper_other – handles paper checks and any uncategorized payments  \n- synthesizer – combines the four mapper reports and flags missed bills, odd amounts and new recurring candidates  \n- receipt_scanner – finds orphaned or mislabeled receipt images and checks them against the expenses database  \n- expense_reconciler – spots expense rows that lack matching receipts (excluding known receipt‑less transactions)  \n- progress_check – reads which reports already exist and how fresh they are  \n\nThere isn’t an agent called “Sam” in our lineup. Is there a particular task you’d like one of the agents to run?",
